    {
      "id": "pocket-polis",
      "name": "Pocket Polis · 口袋審議",
      "summary": "免登入建立陳述、同意／不同意投票與意見群組分析，直接由 polis.mashbean.net 託管活動；收完可發布分層成果收據並接續下一輪。",
      "url": "https://polis.mashbean.net/",
      "source": "https://github.com/mashbean/pocket-polis",
      "status": "integrated",
      "stages": [
        "eliciting",
        "deliberating",
        "reflecting"
      ],
      "goals": [
        "listen",
        "understand",
        "propose",
        "followup"
      ],
      "formats": [
        "hybrid",
        "online"
      ],
      "scales": [
        "small",
        "medium",
        "large"
      ],
      "privacy": [
        "public",
        "pseudonymous"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "insights",
        "proposals",
        "evidence",
        "receipt"
      ],
      "hosting": "cloudflare-worker",
      "deploy": "https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/?url=https://github.com/mashbean/pocket-polis",
      "handoff": "Delib 可免登入代建並交回參與、成果、私人管理三種連結；主辦者可在本機資料工作台驗證 statements.csv 與 votes.csv，再下載可攜 JSON、TTTC CSV 或 Agora 三檔匯入包。達到至少 3 位參與者與逐句 3 份回應門檻後，可挑選 1–8 句陳述、補上解讀與權責，發布不含代號和逐筆投票的成果收據，再接續 Call-in、Harmonica、TTTC 或 Pol.is。管理 token 只留在建立者分頁。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pocket-tttc",
      "name": "Pocket TTTC · 口袋議題樹",
      "summary": "把 id,interview,comment 的 CSV 變成主題 → 子主題 → 可辯論的主張 → 原句引述的議題樹；Talk to the City 的單一 Cloudflare Worker 重寫，免登入、免費額度內可用。",
      "url": "https://ttt-city.mashbean.net/",
      "source": "https://github.com/mashbean/tttc-serverless",
      "status": "integrated",
      "stages": [
        "reflecting",
        "deliberating"
