        "large"
      ],
      "privacy": [
        "pseudonymous",
        "public"
      ],
      "outputs": [
        "insights",
        "evidence"
      ],
      "hosting": "cloudflare-worker",
      "deploy": "https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/?url=https://github.com/mashbean/tttc-serverless",
      "handoff": "Delib 可免登入代建並交回公開報告與一次性管理連結；資料工作台可把口袋審議報告頁、Call-in 或既有的 tttc.csv 合併後直接送出。報告、輸入與管理權杖都留在 Pocket TTTC，Delib 不保存。"
